*
* ## Data Flow
*
* ```mermaid
* flowchart TB
*   user["End User / Browser"]
*   dns["DNS<br/>app.example.com"]
*   cdn["CDN Distribution"]
*   site["S3 Bucket<br/>static site"]
*   api["API Gateway REST"]
*   fn["Lambda Function"]
*   db[("DynamoDB Tables")]
*   logs[("CloudWatch Logs")]
*
*   user --> dns --> cdn
*   cdn --> site
*   cdn --> api --> fn
*   fn --> db
*   fn --> logs
* ```
*
* ## Account Inventory
*
* | Environment | Account Name | Account Number | Bucket |
* |---|---|---|---|
* | dev  | Example Org (dev)  | 000000000000 | example-dev-bucket  |
* | prod | Example Org (prod) | 111111111111 | example-prod-bucket |
*
* ## DNS Names
*
* | Environment | DNS / Certificate Name |
* |---|---|
* | dev        | dev-app.example.com |
* | all others | app.example.com     |
*
* ## Components Created
*
* | Area | Resources |
* |---|---|
* | Static site &amp; API | Static-site bucket, CDN distribution + origin access control, API Gateway REST API + stage, Lambda function, certificate, DNS records |
* | Security &amp; data  | KMS key + alias, IAM roles/policies, user pool + app client, DynamoDB tables, CloudWatch log groups |
